<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        
        .hero-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        
        .hero-title {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        
        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }
        
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .stats-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 40px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }
        
        .stat-item {
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        
        .alert {
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: none;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <% if (message) { %>
            <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
                <%= message %>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
            </div>
        <% } %>
        
        <div class="hero-section">
            <h1 class="hero-title">
                <i class="fas fa-plane-departure"></i> 旅遊易
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">您的智能旅遊個人助理，讓旅行規劃變得簡單輕鬆</p>
            <a href="/create" class="cta-button">
                <i class="fas fa-plus"></i> 開始規劃旅程
            </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>智能搜索</h3>
                    <p>自動搜索最優惠的航班、酒店和景點，為您節省時間和金錢</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-robot"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>AI 助手</h3>
                    <p>智能生成個性化旅遊攻略，包含景點、美食、交通等完整信息</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>自動提醒</h3>
                    <p>旅行前三天自動發送完整報告到您的郵箱，讓您無需擔心遺漏</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="stats-section">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span class="stat-number">1000+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">成功規劃旅程</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span class="stat-number">50+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">目的地覆蓋</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span class="stat-number">98%</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">用戶滿意度</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span class="stat-number">24/7</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">智能服務</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-list"></i> 查看旅遊計劃</h3>
                    <p>管理您的所有旅遊計劃，查看詳細信息和狀態</p>
                    <a href="/plans" class="btn btn-outline-primary">查看計劃</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-question-circle"></i> 如何使用</h3>
                    <p>簡單三步驟：輸入目的地 → 選擇日期 → 等待智能報告</p>
                    <a href="/create" class="btn btn-outline-primary">立即開始</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>